A full-screen intro where my word is made of thousands of small dots. When the page loads, the dots swarm in from all over the screen and settle into the letters. Moving my cursor pushes dots out of the way, and clicking makes them explode outward and then pull back into the word.

Colors: background #FFE3F1, text #4A0532, secondary text #8A2B66, accents #FF1F8E, #1FA9DB, #FFC21A. Font: "Anybody" from Google Fonts.
- Your word: "peak"
- Snap-back strength: 0.02
- Bounciness: 0.86
- Click blast: 40

One React component file, no extra libraries, with a usage example.
Keep it smooth, accessible, and respectful of reduced motion."
`;

