A card with a name and a title in the middle of the page that tilts in 3D toward my cursor. A glare highlight and a rainbow foil sheen slide across it as it tilts, and it springs back to rest when I leave. On a phone it can follow how I tilt the device after I tap "Use motion".

Colors: background #021B2E, text #DDF7FF, secondary text #93BFD3, accents #00E6D2, #8B7DFF, #FF5FC8. Font: "Anybody" from Google Fonts.
- Name: "[YOUR NAME]"
- Glare: 0.5
- Foil shine: 0.6
- Max tilt: 14°
- Springiness: 0.15

One index.html file, CSS and JS inline, no libraries.
Keep it smooth, accessible, and respectful of reduced motion."
`;

